    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "cd902930-dbad-4e7a-854b-2b6a31774d75",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def classification_model(row):\n",
        "    rp = row[\"Reactor_Power\"]\n",
        "    pt = row[\"Propulsion_Type\"]\n",
        "    sc = row[\"Ship_Class\"]\n",
        "    gc = row[\"Galactic_Credits\"]\n",
        "    mc = row[\"Model_Cycle\"]\n",
        "    \n",
        "    if mc <= 7509.8: \n",
        "        return \"Critical\"\n",
        "    \n",
        "    if mc >= 7517.12:\n",
        "        return \"Pristine\"\n",
        "        \n",
        "    if gc > 350000 and gc < 460000:\n",
        "        return \"Critical\"\n",
        "        \n",
        "    if gc >= 23819 and gc < 132000:\n",
        "        return \"Pristine\"\n",
        "        \n",
        "    if gc <= 8273:\n",
        "        return \"Critical\"\n",
        "        \n",
        "    if pt in (\"Graviton Beam\", \"Antimatter\"):\n",
        "        return \"Pristine\"\n",
        "    \n",
        "    if pt == \"Plasma Thruster\":\n",
        "        if rp > 60:\n",
        "            return \"Pristine\"\n",
        "        else:  \n",
        "            return \"Critical\"\n",
        "    \n",
        "    if pt == \"Nuclear Pulse\":\n",
        "        if rp > 80: \n",
        "            return \"Pristine\"\n",
        "        \n",
        "    \n",
        "    if sc == \"Freighter\":\n",
        "        if rp >= 80:\n",
        "            return \"Pristine\"\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            return \"Critical\"\n",
        "    \n",
        "    if sc in (\"Fighter\", \"Speedster\"):\n",
        "        return \"Critical\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    \n",
        "    return \"Operational\"\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "05ea6996",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Each ship is classified by checking the rules from top to bottom.  \n",
        "Based on what condition is triggered we predict the Hull_Integrity:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Output can be Critical, Operational, or Pristine.\n",
        "- If no condition is triggered, the ship is labeled as Operational by default (as the majority of the ships are Operational)\n",
        "\n",
        "## Rules\n",
        "### based on Model Cycle (based on `\"Distribution of ships with different Hull Integrity based on Model Cycle.\"` heatmap)\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Old models are always Critical  \n",
        "   - If Model_Cycle ≤ 7509.8 → classify as Critical.\n",
        "\n",
        "2. Latest models are always Pristine  \n",
        "   - If Model_Cycle ≥ 7517.12 → classify as Pristine.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "### based on Galactic Credits (based on `\"Distribution of ships with different Hull Integrity based on Galactic Credits.\"` heatmap)\n",
        "\n",
        "3. Very high‑priced niche band is Critical  \n",
        "   - If 350000 < Galactic_Credits < 460000 → classify as Critical.\n",
        "\n",
        "4. Standard high‑priced ships are Pristine  \n",
        "   - If 23819 ≤ Galactic_Credits < 132000 → classify as Pristine.\n",
        "\n",
        "5. Cheapest ships are Critical  \n",
        "   - If Galactic_Credits ≤ 8273 → classify as Critical.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "### based on Propulsion Type (based on `\"Distribution of Ships with various Reacator Power across different Hull Integrities and Propulsion Types\"` catplot and `\"Count of Ships in different Propulsion Types and Hull Integrities\"` countplot)\n",
        "\n",
        "6. Advanced exotic drives are Pristine  \n",
        "   - If Propulsion_Type is Graviton Beam or Antimatter → classify as Pristine.\n",
        "\n",
        "7. Plasma Thruster depends on Reactor Power  \n",
        "   - If Propulsion_Type is Plasma Thruster and Reactor_Power > 60 → Pristine.  \n",
        "   - If Propulsion_Type is Plasma Thruster and Reactor_Power ≤ 60 → Critical.\n",
        "\n",
        "8. Nuclear Pulse with very strong reactor is Pristine  \n",
        "   - If Propulsion_Type is Nuclear Pulse and Reactor_Power > 80 → Pristine.  \n",
        "   - (If Reactor_Power ≤ 80, this rule does nothing and evaluation continues.)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "### based on Ship Class (based on `\"Distribution of Ships with various Reacator Power across different Hull Integrities and Ship Classes\"` catplot and `\"Count of Ships in different Ship Classes and Hull Integrities\"` countplot)\n",
        "\n",
        "9. Freighters depend on Reactor Power  \n",
        "   - If Ship_Class is Freighter and Reactor_Power ≥ 80 → Pristine.  \n",
        "   - If Ship_Class is Freighter and Reactor_Power < 80 → Critical.\n",
        "\n",
        "10. Aggressive classes are always Critical  \n",
        "    - If Ship_Class is Fighter or Speedster → Critical.\n",
        "\n",
        "### fallback rule\n",
        "\n",
        "11. Fallback classification  \n",
        "    - If none of the above conditions match → classify as Operational. (based on `\"Count of Ship in based on Hull Integrity\"`)\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "13752e4f",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "features[\"Prediction\"] = features.apply(lambda row: classification_model(row), axis=1)"
      ]
    },
